      "ref": "spells:spell/imprisonment"
    }
  ],
  "text": "Prison keepers among velstracs, vincuvicar velstracs thrive on depriving others of freedom.\n\nVincuvicar Thrones\n\nEach vincuvicar possesses a personal, spiked iron throne—a symbol of authority. This iron throne is an object with Hardness 20 and 500 Hit Points. If a vincuvicar's throne is destroyed, the velstrac must return to the Shadow Plane to acquire or construct a replacement."
